[URI]       Resource identity shared by SCM entries, providers, and document models.
[COMMAND]   Shared command dispatch connects UI actions to handlers.


SHARED ELEMENT KEY
==================
Matching S-numbers identify the same component across both diagrams.
Callouts also mark references inside method names and descriptive text.

[S1] EditorService
[S2] TextModelResolverService
[S3] FileService
[S4] TextFileService
[S5] TextModel
